  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South East Asia - Weather and Climate Science for Service Partnership (WCSSP) - Calls - tender</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to help improve modelling capability of high impact weather in the region, enabling mitigation of risk from extreme weather events</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened partnership between meteorological services in UK, Vietnam, Philippines, Malaysia and Indonesia to produce scoping study identifying S-E Asian region weather forecasting and climate research priorities. This includes training needs analysis for future capacity building work and initial survey of severe weather and DRR services.</narrative>
  </description>
